            "notes": "Here is where we add [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36).\nThis perk is a big part of this build, you keep it all the way through, until you can afford [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429), but it\u2019s unlikely you\u2019ll swap off of Wrist Wraps until round 7. \nYou may think this extra attack speed is unneeded, but it really makes the difference between you and the enemy hitscan, most Ashe players don\u2019t use attack speed and you can often times win the Ashe duels quite easily even with bad aim. It\u2019s just overall better for hitting your shots and being able to get more value from your burn.",
