            "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:27:31.516418+00:00",
            "notes": "Double Barrelled is really where the strong against dive heroes part comes in \ud83d\ude0e \n\n[Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) is a huge part of this build. You deal increased damage to burning opponents, which is why the added attack speed from [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) helps a lot!\n\nIf the enemy support are outhealing a lot \nyou can already get [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) here, and pick up Infrared Lenses next round. \n\nIf you are struggling to stay alive, your support aren\u2019t good etc. then you can pick up [Firestarter](item_8b678022-0eeb-4535-8413-8ad1dbda82d3) here or at any point, just buy the other powers in the same order afterwards.",
